       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-CAUST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-CAUST-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CAUSTIC-ENVELOPE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCATTERING-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-IRRADIANCE-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CAUSTIC-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CAUSTIC-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-CAUST-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PCC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PCC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CAUSTIC-AND-SCATTER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-IRRADIANCE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PCC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CAUSTIC-AND-SCATTER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CAUSTIC-ENVELOPE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCATTERING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-IRRADIANCE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-IRRADIANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CAUSTIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PCC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CAUSTIC-ENVELOPE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SCATTERING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-IRRADIANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CAUSTIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CAUSTIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PCC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PCC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PCC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PCC-CODE.
